{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_title", "source_sha256": "dd8c6e10940124e631ea547741fef5ae5be773f72e44decbf7e58a895527ba06", "ja": "あなたが教えてくれたから", "zh": "因为是你教会了我", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0e52f0569e55901baf71ac15f09233358923ebb0563d6f2050ae520943cecfb6", "ja": "社長にポーカーで負けて以降、イベントで\nあえて笑顔を見せないよう努める瑞希。\n「ファンの人達はクール系の私が好き」だと\n言う瑞希に、プロデューサーは「だからこそ\n自然な笑顔が嬉しい」と背中を押す。", "zh": "自从玩扑克输给社长后，瑞希在活动中\n便刻意努力不露出笑容。\n面对说出“粉丝们喜欢帅气系的我”的\n瑞希，制作人开导并鼓励她说：“正因如此，\n看到自然的笑容才会更高兴”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9b06dc9f1d7b46eef8bebed35865f4698046c2ea3fd2c1b61aa7501d6e3fff07", "ja": "（今日の仕事は、イベントでのミニライブと、\n握手会……いい公演の宣伝になりそうだ）", "zh": "（今天的工作是活动上的迷你演唱会和握手会……看来能为公演做很好的宣传）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9ac8f760cbc2175de385c48b29df19a633e81eeb359d0ddf706971e6220fb2eb", "ja": "みんな、今日は来てくれてありがと～！\nみんなに会えて、すっごくうれしいです♪", "zh": "大家，今天能来真是太谢谢啦～！\n能见到大家，我超级开心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "468bf159e301ef8a6078c89414e74e93c4965bd769a8e6e7fdda46c4f4a01d91", "ja": "皆さんとお会いすると、\n私たちも力をもらえます。", "zh": "与大家见面后，我们也能获得力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "eda12c05d77f538d9f9cda4c4c0713e0b4cc948e85498219f1a628a32080e9f4", "ja": "そんなみなさんに、感謝を込めて……この後の\n握手会も、どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "向这样的各位表达感谢……接下来的握手会，也请大家多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1005_fun", "source_sha256": "7a9870432dc255c3b08e098b2c4094e5be0efc896f707c2352a5c62fe2748dc0", "ja": "瑞希ちゃん、公演がんばってください！\nあの、ぜったい観に行きます！", "zh": "瑞希，加油演出！\n那个，我一定会去看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "5ea8f548295d96007cc3dc5b00a4d2ea3a76cbd3235f54fd5afed1fd6a291256", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n……はっ。公演、がんばります。……キリッ。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n……啊。演出，我会加油的。……（严肃）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b2625bcfa758b39004a03ef2b473d690a277b48b5c141a213e56f345e06c7ad1", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！　1部は無事終わったな。\n昼休憩のあと、2部が始まる。その前に……。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！1部顺利结束了。\n午休过后，2部就要开始了。在那之前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1009_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1010_staff", "source_sha256": "13d28d6a436e10aa2961ab605d3056c291b3424e002fb45f8cecff4bc3c2e378", "ja": "765プロさん、ちょっといいですか？\n2部の前に、ちょっと打ち合わせしたいんですが……。", "zh": "765事务所各位，能打扰一下吗？\n在第2场之前，想稍微和大家开个碰头会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1011_p", "source_sha256": "554474fd0bcf2bfe062fc8966c856638d191d6e42e5346541d56a279e7d8ced6", "ja": "はい、わかりました！", "zh": "好，我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6cd0906d3ab0c7d550e3d28e3836c8135ae50f54dc70622a15995f7d8687474f", "ja": "すまない、ちょっと行ってくる。みんなは\nお弁当を食べたり、休憩しておいてくれ。", "zh": "抱歉，我先离开一会儿。你们先吃便当、休息一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "508af7c1a244017ada17fd18202b420671131a0db3332f64c6ba05d40ce5e3af", "ja": "うん！　いってらっしゃい、\n{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯！路上小心，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1014_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "027ea5d016c3b3578efec6a84ae5b7545f8132b57e998d80cb4a7a4e55e9403e", "ja": "……あの、真壁さん。\n少し、聞いてもいいですか？", "zh": "……那个，真壁小姐。\n可以问您件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "1fc3f2789d2d8b7491f94d6785c2af4214f3ea2f14785e63aa8430ac9a175e52", "ja": "はい。なんでしょう。", "zh": "是，什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e797924be2a8bb8f80c6b70b7939c82185bfa443d8a12e3b8d498b737cd44967", "ja": "握手会で、何かあったのでしょうか？　なんだか、\n笑顔が少なかったような気がしたものですから。", "zh": "握手会上，是发生什么事了吗？总觉得……你好像没怎么笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "6fc8c0c085fd31468828f6bf3fb4cc9374fac1d6b3783953f1d2abb7b9e2263d", "ja": "握手会では、何もありません。\nですが……。", "zh": "握手会上没发生什么。\n但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "6f0ac60797005edfcbd9592e9acea0a0dc84036b1c446e86bcd0963175c74a68", "ja": "今日は、笑顔を控えようかと思いまして。\nそれだけです。", "zh": "今天，我想着还是少笑一点。仅此而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "656ebcbbbaef7b72dff870b2641ceaea6101f02d84ebc66002efb26dcf730d33", "ja": "笑顔を控える？\n瑞希、なんでそんなことしてるの？", "zh": "少笑一点？\n瑞希，你为什么要这么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "66d61165fce5983ebd35deb09def2eaf54e796a21ec03fa2d59a74879e1c17e0", "ja": "そのほうが、ファンの方もうれしいかと思いまして。\n……ファンサービス。", "zh": "我想，那样粉丝们或许会更高兴。  \n……粉丝服务。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e01cef448e3721da39cf8d2ccbc6fc16edca3cf5d5d90b44cf933744c6a2d738", "ja": "え、どういうこと？　瑞希ちゃんが\n笑わないほうが、お客さんは喜ぶの？", "zh": "诶，什么意思？难道瑞希不笑，客人们反而会更开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "a2b8462cf6e33fa87b2c7788c28b25a80f29aa73888ac70b288ad4bc82461b02", "ja": "はい。アイドルになってから、ファンの人に、\nコメントやお手紙をいただくことがありますが……。", "zh": "是的。成为偶像后，我有时会收到粉丝们的留言和来信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "65f81bbdc6bff46a64e029c59718a9fb87300f7953db363577f62b5f149e06de", "ja": "そこに書かれているのです。\n『クールな表情がいい』と。", "zh": "上面写着：\n“冷酷的表情很棒。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "81cf0070d047d08f60cedc40f723c48485135547a72d305fb922f181fdb57d00", "ja": "それは……たしかに、私もそういった言葉を\nいただくことはありますが……。", "zh": "那个……确实，我也会收到这样的评价……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "881a49813c152ab267b14a7938a0bce1d7e948ceab21c8b7ee6db2c5f32036da", "ja": "はい。私と白石さんは、同じ\nクール系美少女ユニットの一員ですから。", "zh": "是的。因为我和白石小姐都是冷酷系美少女组合的成员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "edd047db9e422a700623fa9e893ae879363eaa21bbaad3321d8d568e9cbbb6e1", "ja": "ファンの人たちが求めているなら、プロとして、\nそこに応えていかなくてはならないのではないか、と。", "zh": "既然粉丝们有所期待，作为专业人士，就必须回应他们的期待，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "96cf73d5c7e380a0ada2f792b7b1d7be43eeb4c891616c4fff7d2f4f0ae2f9cc", "ja": "な、なるほど。プロとして……。", "zh": "原、原来如此。作为专业偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "59a94ac871401f72d061388418a2302bcbf3ab532141976eaff39aca7a4881b4", "ja": "えー、そうかな？　たしかに、瑞希ちゃんも\n紬さんも、クール系って感じだけど……。", "zh": "诶——是这样吗？确实，瑞希和紬给人的感觉都是冷酷型的，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c699070def948ea17999f4eb7d21a47eb5332210f9bde153ce73fd4e8a6818ef", "ja": "だからって、笑わない方がいいなんて、\n考えすぎじゃない？", "zh": "但也不至于因此就觉得不该笑吧，是不是想太多了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f8cca8065ec3afecb48209ca1c06e4b02cd479ac7f9c80dcd49bfb6218164dec", "ja": "そ、そうですね……。あの、\n水瀬さんと、我那覇さんは、どう思われますか？", "zh": "是、是这样呢……那个，水濑小姐和我那霸小姐，你们觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1032_013hib", "source_sha256": "648ae404c93cf32062c5fc331c9bdb5864161a114591bcbde5ec4c08a2781a02", "ja": "うーん。瑞希の言うこと、わからなくもないけど……\nでも全然笑わないのは、やりすぎじゃない？", "zh": "嗯……瑞希说的也不是不能理解，但是……\n可是一点都不笑，是不是有点太过头了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1033_007ior", "source_sha256": "2c3acc5f628f335597c39d6724c2dfad66ee2df08fbcc26b14b5718c46fabfd3", "ja": "そうよね。そもそも瑞希の笑顔自体、\nレアっていうか……あっ。", "zh": "是啊。说起来，瑞希的笑容本身就很稀有……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1034_007ior", "source_sha256": "4e6354d84a37b41cf8fd248c2215ef3ad9a62d205753fc7476dbd4bcd2a9a5a0", "ja": "ねえ、瑞希。もしかしてこの前、私と響が\n「最近笑顔が増えた」って言ったこと、気にしてるの？", "zh": "喂，瑞希。难道说，你还在介意之前我和响说过“你最近笑容变多了”这件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1035_044miz", "source_sha256": "4328f3cd003c00bd0e90d7fc5cfe6c2a661e20e02ad144d91f5a05ef81bb7783", "ja": "そうですね……水瀬さんと我那覇さんの言葉が、\n表情を意識するきっかけになったのはたしかですが。", "zh": "是的……水濑小姐和我那霸小姐的话，\n确实成了我开始注意表情的契机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1036_044miz", "source_sha256": "4f933aeb8f5d43c8b19cec76fd17d37eb9bf18639d333bc8a46d82b31b740f57", "ja": "でも一番の理由は、得意のポーカーで、\n社長に負けてしまったことだと思います。", "zh": "不过，我觉得最主要的原因，还是在自己擅长的扑克上输给了社长吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1037_007ior", "source_sha256": "2db6aee99b1ae46dbfa27ab00dda9a83363757421bd7460113d4858b7ff51b87", "ja": "なるほどね……。けど、ポーカーに負けたからって、\nクールじゃなくなったってわけじゃないと思うわよ？", "zh": "原来如此……不过，我觉得就算输给社长扑克，也不代表你就不酷了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1038_013hib", "source_sha256": "39b32301d67d76fa3576856247e28a265d96bfe1ed0ae743438a7826e8bd90b8", "ja": "うんうん。それに、すっごく変わったんじゃなく、\n笑顔が、前よりちょっと増えたってだけだし。", "zh": "嗯嗯。而且，也不是发生了巨大的改变，只是比以前多了一点笑容而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1039_013hib", "source_sha256": "4c1d0510f9d7712f27c58987cf6cd340ce4ee903c8d51400a1c2921c3f995c62", "ja": "それって、アイドルとしてはいいことなんじゃないの？\n志保や紬だって、笑う時は笑うでしょ。", "zh": "那不是作为偶像来说挺好的吗？\n志保和紬不也是该笑的时候会笑吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1040_007ior", "source_sha256": "33546201a100811643f93ab6aa1a84baf30318d2ba45d0e22195b948cd99eeb3", "ja": "ま、そうは言っても、瑞希も紬も、\nまだまだ仏頂面してる時の方が多いけどね。", "zh": "不过话虽如此，瑞希和紬还是板着脸的时候更多就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1041_044miz", "source_sha256": "9303ab529123b8c70855302480b8b8955386328f59f131c05f39cf40a1d3ee31", "ja": "仏頂面……がーん。", "zh": "臭着一张脸……咣当。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1042_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d2f7ca673339af320b8297d2906b1bda599194483dbf7d599500fe72ebe80ba3", "ja": "わ、私も、それほど仏頂面をしている\nつもりはないのですが……。", "zh": "我、我也并不觉得自己有\n板着脸到那种地步就是了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1043_007ior", "source_sha256": "05af17390747c3c849b1697cabaa466836622e4203fe0b03494bb360b81abad1", "ja": "冗談よ。でも、瑞希。あんた本当に、\nこの先ずっと、笑顔を見せないつもり？", "zh": "开玩笑的啦。不过，瑞希，你真的打算从今以后一直不露笑容吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1044_044miz", "source_sha256": "5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4", "ja": "それは……。", "zh": "你的意思是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1045_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c0a875fc3b4baac9980335551187c89ccb1abcefa941fc3914ecb7099d691bb2", "ja": "そうだよ～。全然笑わないなんて、\nそれはそれで、瑞希ちゃんらしくないよ～！", "zh": "没错呀～。完全不笑什么的，那样反而不像瑞希了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1046_044miz", "source_sha256": "49c0f2c9eb084feaa2da9577ea7db3fdefd2231dc7e8ac10563765f529aa6a4b", "ja": "ですが、私は……。", "zh": "可是，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1047_044miz", "source_sha256": "0ed716328650ca5834300148a4e1019c382f14566a80caf16352fce6e2644f57", "ja": "私は、表情が豊かではないアイドルです。でもファンの\nみなさんは、こんな私を応援してくれている……。", "zh": "我是个表情并不丰富的偶像。但是，粉丝们却愿意支持这样的我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1048_044miz", "source_sha256": "d565621979f46dc8b94a310f653388199ce6c70b4d2ebf8e25ef1c0710ebb4a9", "ja": "そんなみなさんの期待を、裏切りたくはありません。\n……。", "zh": "我不想辜负大家对我的期待。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1049_051tmg", "source_sha256": "458b8eb9512543d37514d9d4c5e8699cbef8941d0831a10ca73263504cbfee95", "ja": "真壁さん……。", "zh": "真壁小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1053_044miz", "source_sha256": "c071deceff3714703b22a57d7f65994a570247b91465d152bfe322f06229b6fe", "ja": "私は……どうすればいいのでしょうか……。", "zh": "我……该怎么办才好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1054_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6f4577e08a2504345b2a6986a9558340a4ff860bb75d4660df2535c9f2f04fd3", "ja": "そういう時は、{$P$}さんに\n聞いてみるのがいいんじゃない？", "zh": "这种时候，去问问{$P$}先生不是挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1055_044miz", "source_sha256": "50ecdde53bea4d8bc95410223c5ebfe1b1099aa1622a27b7c6dfd7344d008bcb", "ja": "{$P$}に……？", "zh": "问{$P$}……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1056_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ab8eae3e1eaecfeb42e250cfbb4e40d4b0afae6154ac4a5cf0dd6feb709ac90f", "ja": "私も、それがいいと思います。それに、\n何かあれば、相談に乗ると言っていました。", "zh": "我也觉得这样很好。而且，还说有什么事可以找他商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1057_013hib", "source_sha256": "b11c7a45b95127a7d45f48f202ca10194739498c763e80a4b4c153529a83ac89", "ja": "うん。たしかに、{$P$}に\n聞いたほうがいいかもしれない。", "zh": "嗯。确实，问问{$P$}\n可能比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1058_007ior", "source_sha256": "191afcc05f0b4aa8718d25a9454e3ec8e25435784e3617dd183965288840dff0", "ja": "そうね。だいたい、『クール系美少女ユニット』なんて\n言い出したのも、{$P$}でしょ？", "zh": "没错。要说“冷酷系美少女组合”什么的，不就是{$P$}提出来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1059_007ior", "source_sha256": "cd05973fa6b581e5ecdee7c48735ad5fba11d254b4a38d8700ff9b8acadd56e0", "ja": "だったら、ちゃんと責任を取らせればいいのよ！\nプロデューサーなんだから。", "zh": "既然这样，那就让他好好负起责任来啊！\n毕竟他可是制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1060_044miz", "source_sha256": "0fad3f503edc1c7071c0b6adba0fbe68b43f007edc68b5c4c55cdd778642f436", "ja": "そう、ですね。\n……みなさん、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "是啊。\n……谢谢大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1061_044miz", "source_sha256": "6263cec2dc9b55f29e813f8765829c3d76ac91270c25387240436376f53fc81b", "ja": "{$P$}に、相談してみます。", "zh": "我去找{$P$}商量一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1063_p", "source_sha256": "70abbe0df09243884952ddbef8dda64468fa73cbce1516bb263f4ea031c812d7", "ja": "（今日の握手会、大盛況だったな。この調子で、\n公演も盛り上げていきたいところだけど……）", "zh": "（今天的握手会真是盛况空前啊。要是能乘着这股势头，也让公演热闹起来就好了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1064_p", "source_sha256": "69302ac900dbc5f3b0cf5cf1007837c50fb6b6c13b53de8b05ac5eb9db045ba9", "ja": "（瑞希、2部でも少し表情が硬かったな。\n明日改めて、話を聞いてみるか……）", "zh": "（瑞希在2部时表情也有些僵硬啊。明天再找她问问情况吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1065_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1066_044miz", "source_sha256": "f247839fa3fe7df96fb112c4ba4e4d6c3b67a19cd8469553eaabdce0980ac804", "ja": "{$P$}。\nちょっと、いいでしょうか。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n可以打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1067_p", "source_sha256": "5af6d0e4b8a4e107f6fe3e28637a9a5fcdb576ddb589a824853b92d495d7ce6e", "ja": "あ、瑞希……お疲れ様。いいけど、どうしたんだ？\nやっぱり、新曲で何か気になるとか……。", "zh": "啊，瑞希……辛苦了。可以啊，怎么了？\n果然，是对新歌有什么在意的地方吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1068_044miz", "source_sha256": "858478a7fe1cd3e38b14561a3b56e37f530b70aeab1716f61dcabbea668f3bff", "ja": "はい。実は、{$P$}に\n助けてほしいことがあります。……緊急事態、だぞ。", "zh": "好的。其实，我有件事想请{$P$}帮忙。……这是紧急情况哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1069_p", "source_sha256": "454bbc0fa1c5ce6fbefa9a2220385d77185f29b6e4464d779d5b06320c411a72", "ja": "その割には落ち着いて見えるけど……\nええと、順を追って話してみてくれるか？", "zh": "话虽如此，你看起来倒是挺冷静的……\n呃，能按顺序说说看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1070_044miz", "source_sha256": "3f941da46600de18178a86363cc98a366d62446a0f780855771e870fb8a8947e", "ja": "はい。……劇場のみなさんが言うには、\n最近の私には、笑顔が増えたそうです。", "zh": "是的。……剧场的大家都说，\n最近的我，笑容变多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1071_p", "source_sha256": "c01865a71a5a4d298e1e051b7795ebe41156a57c1ec361c376da27647aa275ed", "ja": "うん、そうだな。", "zh": "嗯，没错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1072_044miz", "source_sha256": "672c48b31dd7e03b75dd68a82187588c8cb83c92082caab61773bcf448748d92", "ja": "がーん。", "zh": "打击。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1073_p", "source_sha256": "54488836aee95d66bfac2ba6185adaa6b4d2df8f8c7028488e1e6da41d7972d7", "ja": "え、何か問題があるのか？", "zh": "诶，有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1074_044miz", "source_sha256": "e9201f0e8097a8ea842efc1f7b15feaec3d6af2ee6a0ae2ea330ca3c508176a3", "ja": "はい。……私は、クール系美少女ユニットの一員。\nファンの人も、クールな表情がいいと言ってくれます。", "zh": "是的……我可是冷酷系美少女组合的一员。  \n粉丝们也都说，我摆出冷酷的表情很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1075_p", "source_sha256": "02072ad339edf3f6589cfa4cdc6f51a1e7fc3fe42f39ece9589a32c80e9a5e15", "ja": "そういえばそうだったな……。\nあ、だから笑顔が増えるのはダメって事か？", "zh": "说起来，确实是这样……  \n啊，所以说，笑容变多是不行的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1076_044miz", "source_sha256": "70e62ff5e3191cdf14f611297bee930e828438f7df94482becce1ecc6f9145e4", "ja": "はい。このままでは、ファンの人たちが好きな、\nクールな瑞希ではなくなってしまいます。……しゅん。", "zh": "是的。这样下去，就会变得不再是粉丝们喜欢的那个酷酷的瑞希了。……失落。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1077_p", "source_sha256": "988e428c55eec2061897f28572c2734fe82c3f4a3b06fa06bf9957c8f5500f00", "ja": "確かに、クールな瑞希はかっこいいもんな。\n前のソロ曲も、評判良かったし。", "zh": "确实，酷酷的瑞希很帅气呢。\n之前的独唱曲口碑也很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1078_044miz", "source_sha256": "fc162d089e9b808e290fefb5712f001766c358c4d2c2fc02f507f165b047c1ca", "ja": "てへ。", "zh": "嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1079_044miz", "source_sha256": "58a5ce6c27a8ec3a37be69155fdd024b33b03a10d6441585b1f14ced237ecd8a", "ja": "あっ……ですが、次の曲はかわいらしいです。\nとても素敵な曲ですが、私には……。", "zh": "啊……不过，下一首歌很可爱。\n虽然是非常棒的歌，但对我来说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1080_p", "source_sha256": "78104d54c82795a5dfc793717a1423f9d13013e3294b65578fdc4f8503535514", "ja": "そうか。でも、だからこそ、\nあの曲がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "这样啊。不过正因为如此，\n那首歌不是更合适吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1081_044miz", "source_sha256": "a61d304acbca01dc2ab39315b87a90ff0ee6286b98429a8b2f73be4f88d23235", "ja": "？　それは、何故でしょうか。", "zh": "？这是为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1082_p", "source_sha256": "1606706a956724d9d40272a69b7e4b0349862b25a12046a192af73741e7c551e", "ja": "うん。クールな瑞希が自然に笑顔を見せてくれたら、\nファンの人達は、最高に嬉しいんじゃないかなって。", "zh": "嗯。如果酷酷的瑞希能自然地露出笑容，粉丝们一定会开心到极点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1083_p", "source_sha256": "f30b56c3c766cb5d4c3688bbd89f72c6c29606d24f2f864c3a91bde0605be4e7", "ja": "あの曲なら、瑞希はきっと自然と笑顔になる。\nそう思ったんだけど。", "zh": "如果是那首歌的话，瑞希一定能自然而然地展露笑容。\n我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1084_044miz", "source_sha256": "9e9f1c309de3621f97e3c6f64bf581bf93d4e76baaa39d9326c038011d960f3a", "ja": "私が笑顔になると、うれしい……。\nそれは……私が笑うのが、珍しいからでしょうか？", "zh": "我笑起来的话，你会高兴……。\n那是……因为我笑得少，所以才觉得难得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1085_p", "source_sha256": "7c49e567feb9d2a9509f229bda7e9173873e709db9a65adb83e075e769bd4c81", "ja": "そうだな。それもあると思う。\nけど、きっとそれだけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "是啊，我想这也是原因之一。\n不过，一定不只是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1086_p", "source_sha256": "c3cc09039eef7cb941395cf3a707f3445391563ebf92f9b7365253278ee13cbf", "ja": "可愛い笑顔の瑞希も、瑞希だからじゃないか？", "zh": "露出可爱笑容的瑞希，不也是瑞希吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1087_044miz", "source_sha256": "f21c841a5651d60f79b00b48b37f8b4e43edf7b217fbea6554a0cc3460751aeb", "ja": "かわいい笑顔の私も、私……。\n……ぽっ。", "zh": "露出可爱笑容的我，也是我……。  \n……脸红了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_112_1088_044miz", "source_sha256": "dfec4c7f9bb542eda399a01743e97a0e4c368b1f7c85f77a25fef86fd2461593", "ja": "{$P$}。\n{$P$}も、そう思いますか。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n{$P$}也这么觉得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
